{"id": "ddb18419-5327-4ae2-9804-996371853a98", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T15:01:27.835331", "source": "user", "parent_id": "650aef91-7803-4dd9-8942-9658a3215659", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{"researcher_request": "请先完成以下三项工作，不必给出完整实验方案：\n\n1) 审查 /workspace 仓库中与 zero bubble pipeline parallelism 相关的实现（尤其 1F1B、1F1B-I、ZB-1p、ZB-2p 四种调度方法），说明这些方法在代码中的位置、各自的调度特征（如 bubble 数量与微批次数 m 的关系、是否采用 zero-bubble 交错调度），以及吞吐量是如何被定义和度量的（是否存在基准/示例脚本、配置文件或其他性能测量入口）。\n\n2) 提出一个待验证的实验设计草案：包括变量（自变量的水平：方法 × 微批次数；因变量：吞吐量，建议明确的度量单位）、保持固定的对照组条件（模型规模、层数/流水线级数、全局批大小、张量并行、参数、优化设置、硬件假设）、以及计划的分析方式（如何比较“随 m 增大吞吐量是否改善”的斜率/趋势，以及 ZB-2p 在较少微批下是否保持高吞吐）。\n\n3) 列出你在设计中最关键的不确定性或假设——例如：吞吐量的具体定义（吞吐 tokens/s vs. 迭代稳态吞吐）、微批次数的取值范围、是否有仓库中已固定不可变的调度约束、以及如何在没有 GPU 执行的情况下论证可行性（本任务为纯设计任务，不要求运行实验）。\n\n请基于仓库实际内容提出证据，不要声称实验已运行。本阶段只需给出设计草案与关键假设，供后续讨论。", "required_handoff_stage": "plan", "approach_approved": false, "public_task": {"question": "Does the throughput for methods 1F1B, 1F1B-I, and ZB-1p improve as the number of microbatches increases, while ZB-2p maintains high throughput even with fewer microbatches? (Note: These methods are implemented as part of the zero bubble pipeline parallelism strategies in this repository, which aim to reduce pipeline bubbles and maintain high throughput.)", "context": "Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.", "environment": {"runtime": "bubblewrap", "network": "disabled", "repository": "/workspace", "python": "python3", "software_environment": "system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled", "datasets": [], "gpu_enabled": false, "cpu_affinity_count": 224, "note": "Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment."}, "researcher_topics": [], "question_budget": 6, "actor_step_budget": 60, "continue_after_initial_plan": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name":